# novadeck-gpu-priority — an implicit Vulkan layer that runs a game's queues at LOW global
# priority, so the Steam UI, Xwayland and mangoapp preempt the game's GPU work instead of queueing
# behind its frames. The source is ours to carry (no upstream tarball): patches/0001 adds it as new
# files into the empty directory the PKGBUILD's prepare() makes, which is how a repo-owned source
# rides this pipeline and gets hashed by packages/inputhash.sh like any other patch.
#
# Enabled per game by NOVADECK_GAME_LOWPRIO=1, which usr/bin/novadeck-steam writes into Steam's
# games-only environment file. See the PKGBUILD and the patch header for the mechanism.
name: novadeck-gpu-priority
pkgbuild_local: PKGBUILD
pkgrel_suffix: 1
patches: 0001-add-the-game-priority-layer.patch
